Interchange StudentDiscipline [2529]
    documentation 'This interchange defines discipline incidents and discipline actions.
    use case documentation '1. Exchange a student's full or partial discipline history.
                           '
                           '2. Exchange a student's updated discipline record.
                           '
                           '3. Exchange school or LEA discipline data.
    element DisciplineIncident [2529-001]
    element StudentDisciplineIncidentAssociation [2529-002]
    element DisciplineAction [2529-003]